    {
      "name": "Wick-Powered",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The living wick is inactive and unconscious while its wick is unlit. When its wick is lit, it obeys the commands of the creature that lit the wick, and it sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for an additional 20 feet. The living wick's hp maximum is reduced by 2 (1d4) for every 24 hours it remains lit and active, and no effect short of a wish spell can remove this reduction. The living wick dies when its hp maximum is reduced to 0."
      ],
